<section class="hiw-page-section">
	<div class="section-label">How it works</div>
	<div class="section-title">
		Compete. <span style="color:var(--orange)">Accumulate.</span><br />Champion.
	</div>
	<p class="section-sub">
		The Florida Racquetball Grand Prix is a first-of-its-kind season series. Play in any or all stops:
		every match you win builds your points total toward the season standings.
	</p>
	<div class="hiw-grid">
		<div class="hiw-card">
			<div class="hiw-num">01</div>
			<div class="hiw-title">Play the stops</div>
			<div class="hiw-desc">
				Register for any of the four Grand Prix tour stops across Florida. Each stop is a standalone event
				with full brackets across all divisions.
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hiw-card">
			<div class="hiw-num">02</div>
			<div class="hiw-title">Earn GP points</div>
			<div class="hiw-desc">
				Finish positions award GP points in singles, doubles, and mixed doubles. Playing with the same
				partner across stops earns partnership bonus points.
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hiw-card">
			<div class="hiw-num">03</div>
			<div class="hiw-title">Climb the board</div>
			<div class="hiw-desc">
				Points accumulate across the season. The leaderboard updates live after each stop. Watch your
				ranking rise as the December closer approaches.
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hiw-card">
			<div class="hiw-num">04</div>
			<div class="hiw-title">Win the title</div>
			<div class="hiw-desc">
				Top point earners in each division lead the statewide standings. The season runs four scored stops
				from Ocala through Eustis—consistency and deep runs decide who finishes on top.
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
